---
layout: main
---
<p>You can sort the folders of your /novels/ folder however you wish, but I recommend having a folder for a series or fandom, and then folders for individual fics inside that.</p>
{% for fandom in collections.novels %}
  <h2>{{ fandom.title }}</h2>

  <dl class="novel-list">
  {% for fic in fandom.stories %}
    <dt>
      <strong><a href="{{ fic.url }}">{{ fic.data.title }}</a></strong>
      {% if fic.data.r18 %}🔞{% endif %}
      {% if fic.data.last-updated %}<em> - Last Updated: {{ fic.data.last-updated | textDate }}</em>{% endif %}
    </dt>
    <dd>{{ fic.data.blurb }}</dd>
  {% endfor %}
  </dl>
{% endfor %}

